{1}{Greetings mortal. I've watched you as you've adventured across the land,I have even traded goods with you  and I have a deal for you.}{Greetings mortal. I've watched you as you've adventured across the land,I have even traded goods with you  and I have a deal for you.}{}{}{}{}
{2}{NO! No more deals, no more quests. I've had enough!}{}{1}{}{}{co}
{3}{I'm listening...}{}{1}{}{4}{}
{4}{People have abandoned the old gods, especially with this Panarii stuff being the "in thing" now. I want to bring their beliefs back to me.}{People have abandoned the old gods, especially with this Panarii stuff being the "in thing" now. I want to bring their beliefs back to me.}{}{}{}{}
{5}{But I like the Panarii beliefs.}{}{1}{}{7}{re-5}
{6}{Yes, the Panarii beliefs are false, I know that myself.}{}{1}{}{7}{}
{7}{Lets say we teach the people a lesson, are you interested in becoming my head priest, so to speak?}{Lets say we teach the people a lesson, are you interested in becoming my head priest, so to speak?}{}{}{}{}
{8}{ I'm no-ones pawn. Leave me out of your games.}{}{1}{}{10}{re-5}
{9}{ What do I get out of it?}{}{1}{}{10}{re +100}
{10}{Remember that I'm a god, my rewards can be limitless...}{Remember that I'm a god, my rewards can be limitless...}{}{}{}{}
{11}{ Yeah yeah, whatever. Not interested in this confusing junk anymore.}{}{1}{}{}{co}
{12}{I don't trust you, what do I get?}{}{1}{}{13}{}
{13}{I can make the most potent killer the world has ever seen, is that not enough?}{I can make the most potent killer the world has ever seen, is that not enough?}{}{}{}{}
{14}{I'm not a killer. Leave me out of this.}{}{1}{}{}{co}
{15}{Yes! I am sorry for doubting you.}{}{1}{}{16}{}
{16}{Lets go to Tarant and show the people the power of the old gods, shall we?}{Lets go to Tarant and show the people the power of the old gods, shall we?}{}{}{}{}
{17}{No! I've changed my mind! Leave us in peace!}{}{1}{}{}{co}
{18}{Lead the way.. Muahahahaha!}{}{1}{}{-4}{gf2792 1}

